c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEF_DU6aZ5wbtK0aB2T0bWTPWANOTyQh5mR2Dy9GPZjIQ&oe=6A7B0EC6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Frame 5.png", "id": "1129080695888294", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/54823267_1129080699221627_5310614923561147564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GFGKqrgxqpgQ7kNvwFw-xVm&_nc_oc=AdqaknO-jlokxjEU2bdyCpkjNsQzNh2n7F5Aa9IfswNJHu_HmOH9Djk7yte4tm0QZVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFcnQUHai8TjC9TBZg7K9dqBaqs-XzjkGoHPXoVqBNUJQ&oe=6A7B19D8"}, "display_name": "Beyond Sandbox", "keywords": ["FPS", "Sandbox", "Shooter", "Multiplayer", "Mod"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate VR modding platform, where your creativity knows no bounds!\n\nPlay groundbreaking in-house VR games that push the limits of immersion, or dive into an endless stream of user-created content. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and the Reality SDK, Beyond Sandbox offers a playground for both players and creators to redefine virtual reality experiences.\n\nDiscover What\u2019s Possible:\n- Next-Level Physics: Interact with the world like never before.\n- Realistic Weapons: Feel the intensity of lifelike firearms and melee combat.\n- Dynamic Multiplayer: Connect, compete, or collaborate in immersive worlds.\n- Procedural Grips: Every hold feels just right.\n- Creator\u2019s Paradise: Modders get powerful tools to build anything imaginable.\n\nPush VR to its limits. Create. Play. Explore. This is Beyond Sandbox.", "short_description": "The Next-Gen VR Modding platform powered by Unreal 5."}]}, "developer_name": "Atlas XR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beyondsandbox.com/privacy-policy-beyond-sandbox", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atlas XR", "support_website_url": "https://beyondsandbox.com/contact-beyond-vr", "website_url": "https://beyondsandbox.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORT